/* iPhone remote control (protocol v2, migration of old Shortcuts) */
"This pairing has expired. On the Mac: Cocaine → Remote work → iPhone → Send, then use the new Shortcut." = "此配对已过期。在 Mac 上:Cocaine → 远程工作 → iPhone → 发送,然后使用新的快捷指令。";
