"Old Shortcuts" = "旧快捷指令";
"Unprotected, still accepted (status, on/off) until %@" = "未受保护,仍接受(状态、开/关)至 %@";
"%d without protection or expired: send a new Shortcut" = "%d 个未受保护或已过期:请发送新的快捷指令";
"Allow 14 days" = "允许 14 天";
"Stop" = "停止";
"Old Shortcuts send plain, unauthenticated text: anyone who learns their relay topic could use them" = "旧快捷指令发送未加密、未认证的文本:任何知道其中继主题的人都能使用它们";
